Recovery
├── requires RECOVERY_ROLE and a position with no missing accounted shares
├── tolerates donated surplus without increasing liabilities or transferring more than tracked shares
├── snapshots only outstanding liabilities after earlier normal withdrawals
├── when only unclaimed yield shares remain and principal is zero
│   ├── transfers the accounted shares without consulting Yearn redemption
│   ├── immediately completes recovery without division, settlement funding, or claim creation
│   └── rejects subsequent funding and settlement activation
├── pauses normal deposits, claims, and redemptions
├── transfers exactly the tracked st-yBOLD balance to recovery treasury
├── accepts settlement ETH only from the configured treasury
├── activates once with sufficient funding and a uniform rate
├── explicitly permits a zero-ETH total-loss settlement while rejecting a nonzero amount rounded to zero rate
├── returns zero claimable yield during recovery without calling the unavailable Yearn integration
├── reverts without accounting changes if committed ETH becomes unavailable
├── settles full or partial-loss claims through the existing YieldManager
├── keeps large and unequal claims pro-rata regardless of payout order
├── caps an oversized final claim at remaining principal
├── prevents repeated transitions and repeated settlement
└── sweeps surplus ETH and donated shares only after every principal claim is settled
